sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Visitor / CLI
    participant S as serve.py / DataAgent
    participant M as ModelClient (Gemini/OpenAI)
    participant T as Tools / :memory: SQLite

    U->>S: Question + CSV/MD context
    S->>M: Phase 1 Plan prompt (tree + difficulty)
    M-->>S: Structured JSON plan
    loop Steps 1..max_steps (with _trim_history + step warnings)
        S->>M: Role-alternating history
        M-->>S: JSON action + action_input
        S->>T: Policy-gated tool call (safe path / query_only SQLite)
        T-->>S: Truncated JSON observation
    end
    Note over S,T: Terminal action = answer(columns, rows)
    S->>M: Phase 3 Verifier (check columns vs question)
    M-->>S: Prune extraneous columns (safe fallback keeps >=1 col)
    S-->>U: Verified Table + Downloadable CSV
